1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,650
Let's practice a cyclic sigh.
Keep every breath easy, never forced.

2
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,350
Breathe in gently through your nose.

3
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,850
A second, smaller sip.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,800
And a long, unhurried sigh out.

5
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,650
Again. Breathe in.

6
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,600
A smaller sip.

7
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:35,200
And a long, unhurried sigh out.

8
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,550
One more. Breathe in.

9
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:45,950
Small sip.

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,300
Breathe all the way out, slowly.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,050
Replay when you're ready.
Let the rhythm grow familiar.
